- `.agent/rules/actormodel.md` - Actor Model details
- `.agent/rules/deadlock.md` - Deadlock prevention
- `.agent/rules/coding_standards.md` - Code style
- `.agent/rules/boss_scripting.md` - Boss AI patterns
